title: A prompt as a mindmap
description: Each main branch becomes a section of the prompt — try "Copy as prompt" or `diagram outline examples/prompt-mindmap.diagram --md`

idea: Ask support how often people complain about re-entering cards [sticky]

mindmap task: Add saved payment methods to checkout [layout: both] {
  Context
    Rails monolith, Stripe already integrated
    Checkout is one page: app/views/checkout
    Customers re-enter cards on every order
  Goal
    Returning customers pay in one click
    Cards stored by Stripe, never by us
  Constraints [red]
    No new services
    PCI scope must not grow
    Feature flag: saved_cards
  Steps
    Model: customer has many payment methods
    Stripe SetupIntent on first payment
    Picker on the checkout page
    Remove a card from the account page
  Acceptance [green]
    Second order needs no card details
    Removing a card detaches it in Stripe
    Flag off: checkout unchanged
  Open questions [collapsed]
    Default card per customer?
    What about expired cards?
}

idea ..> customers-re-enter-cards-on-every-order
